<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Tullow appoints Maleki to its board.</title>
<headline>Tullow appoints Maleki to its board.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tullow Oil Plc said on Thursday that it had appointed Eskandar Maleki to the board with effect from October 2.</p>
<p>Maleki, primarily through Centrotrade Corporation, has an interest in nine percent of Tullow's issued share capital, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
</text>
